NA, 3.086, 4.027, 1.927, 2.254, 5.374, 2.478, 4.307, 3.032…\n\n# 5. Visualizar as primeiras linhas\nhead(laboratorio)\n\n  IMG    TIPO GEN PLANTA   AP AC NR   MC   MG\n1   1 DOURADA  G1     P1 78.0 42  3 4.78 3.76\n2   2 DOURADA  G1     P2 82.0 37  3 6.87 5.30\n3   3 DOURADA  G1     P3 70.0 34  3 3.33 2.66\n4   4 DOURADA  G1     P4 68.0 40  2 2.85 2.32\n5   5 DOURADA  G1     P5 88.0 44  2 5.19 3.91\n6   6 DOURADA  G3     P1 75.5 38  4 8.00 3.97\n\nhead(capsulas)\n\n                                 img id        x        y      area   area_ch\n1 100_Cápsulas_1_2023-12-22-07-58-19  2 532.1983 231.2042 0.3760606 0.3679504\n2 100_Cápsulas_1_2023-12-22-07-58-19  3 425.7173 423.0140 0.3570953 0.3493595\n3 100_Cápsulas_1_2023-12-22-07-58-19  4 554.3911 321.6590 0.3585926 0.3512311\n4 100_Cápsulas_1_2023-12-22-07-58-19  5 462.2101 282.3858 0.3600898 0.3524788\n5 100_Cápsulas_1_2023-12-22-07-58-19  6 512.9692 338.6506 0.3513558 0.3457411\n6 100_Cápsulas_1_2023-12-22-07-58-19  7 590.4902 298.8677 0.3353851 0.3285227\n  perimeter radius_mean radius_min radius_max  radius_sd diam_mean  diam_min\n1  2.251678   0.3388563  0.3154638  0.3739915 0.01283073 0.6777126 0.6309276\n2  2.197744   0.3300150  0.3088185  0.3514735 0.01049265 0.6600299 0.6176370\n3  2.193911   0.3308783  0.3041235  0.3592456 0.01210835 0.6617566 0.6082471\n4  2.220084   0.3316009  0.3049880  0.3684113 0.01274937 0.6632017 0.6099760\n5  2.206998   0.3275266  0.2911485  0.3539325 0.01428226 0.6550532 0.5822970\n6  2.139977   0.3195535  0.2992711  0.3417907 0.01031085 0.6391069 0.5985422\n   diam_max major_axis minor_axis   caliper    length     width radius_ratio\n1 0.7479830  0.2456559  0.2337522 0.7211426 0.7143581 0.6746102     1.185529\n2 0.7029469  0.2364580  0.2304489 0.6909232 0.6879114 0.6514003     1.138123\n3 0.7184913  0.2391584  0.2289740 0.7045140 0.6815191 0.6480365     1.181249\n4 0.7368226  0.2392332  0.2299735 0.7136640 0.6833401 0.6535871     1.207953\n5 0.7078649  0.2391301  0.2242604 0.69667